{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "hover-card",
  "title": "Hover Card",
  "description": "마우스와 포커스로 보는 미리보기",
  "example": "import { Button } from 'moru-ui'\nimport { HoverCard } from 'moru-ui'\n\nexport function MemberPreview() {\n  return (\n    <HoverCard\n      trigger={\n        <Button type=\"button\" variant=\"ghost\">\n          Alex Kim\n        </Button>\n      }\n      title=\"Alex Kim\"\n      description=\"Product designer · Seoul\"\n      side=\"bottom\"\n    >\n      <p>Building thoughtful interfaces with the product team.</p>\n    </HoverCard>\n  )\n}",
  "installCommand": "npm install moru-ui",
  "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/syrus-riius/moru-ui/blob/main/src/components/ui/hover-card.tsx",
